<title>BELGIUM: EU vets GKN /Brambles buy of Mabeg.</title>
<headline>EU vets GKN /Brambles buy of Mabeg.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said in a statement on Tuesday it was starting a preliminary review into the proposed joint acquisition of German waste management firm Mabeg Holding GmbH by GKN Industries Ltd and Brambles Investment Europe BV.</p>
<p>It said the deal was submittted for clearance on November 22 under the European Union's merger rules which ban creation or strengthening of dominant positions. The Commission has about one month from that date to clear the operation or start a full probe.</p>
<p>GKN Industries is controlled by diversified British engineering group GKN Plc. Brambles Investment's parent company is Brambles Industries Ltd from Australia. -- Brussels newsroom 322 2876841</p>
